# Infrastructure notes. This repo is PUBLIC, and the manual records the home WAN IP, the UniFi
# port-forwarding rule and the Cloudflare account id. The WAN IP is the one that matters: the
# api2 DNS record is proxied specifically so the origin address stays hidden, and publishing it
# would undo that. Kept on local disk only.
# The glob is deliberate: this was once an exact filename, and a working copy saved alongside it as
# commuter-infra-manual-after-phase-8.md was therefore untracked but NOT ignored — one `git add .`
# from being public. Any -old / -v2 / -draft variant must stay covered.
commuter-infra-manual*.md
